#: classes/class-ssb-settings.php:666
#: src/components/widgets/SsbGoProSection.jsx:24
msgid "Want to Show Social Sharing Buttons on Your Media?"
msgstr ""
"Želite li da prikažete dugmad za deljenje na društvenim mrežama na vašem "
"mediju?"

#: classes/class-ssb-settings.php:670
msgid ""
"Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you display share buttons directly on images "
"and photos\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tacross your posts and pages, choose their position, add icon "
"spacing, and set custom colors that match your site.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYou can also hide them on mobile and control exactly which "
"post types they appear on.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIt's an easy way to turn every image into a shareable "
"opportunity and drive more traffic."
msgstr ""
"Simple Social Buttons Pro vam omogućava da prikažete dugmad za deljenje "
"direktno na slikama i fotografijama\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tu vašim objavama i stranicama, izaberete njihovu poziciju, "
"dodate razmak između ikona i postavite prilagođene boje koje odgovaraju "
"vašem sajtu.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTakođe možete da ih sakrijete na mobilnim uređajima i "
"precizno kontrolišete na kojim tipovima objava se pojavljuju.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTo je jednostavan način da svaku sliku pretvorite u priliku "
"za deljenje i povećate posetu."

#: classes/class-ssb-settings.php:684
#: src/components/widgets/SsbGoProSection.jsx:29
msgid "Want Smart Popups That Trigger at the Right Moment?"
msgstr "Želite li pametne iskačuće prozore koji se aktiviraju u pravom trenutku?"

#: classes/class-ssb-settings.php:688
msgid ""
"Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you create a custom share popup with your "
"own title and message,\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand trigger it exactly when it matters, like before visitors "
"leave or after they scroll.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYou can add animation, display share counts or total shares "
"to build social proof, and set custom colors to match your brand.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIt's a smart way to catch visitor attention right when "
"they're most likely to share."
msgstr ""
"Simple Social Buttons Pro vam omogućava da kreirate prilagođeni iskačući "
"prozor sa svojim naslovom i porukom,\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\ti aktivirate ga tačno kada je to važno, poput trenutka kada "
"posetioci napuštaju stranicu ili nakon što skroluju.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tM možete dodati animaciju, prikazati broj deljenja ili ukupne "
"delove kako biste izgradili društveni dokaz, i postaviti prilagođene boje "
"koje odgovaraju vašem brendu.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTo je pametan način da privučete pažnju posetilaca baš kada "
"su najverovatnije da podele."

#: classes/class-ssb-settings.php:702
#: src/components/widgets/SsbGoProSection.jsx:34
msgid "Want Advanced Fly In Animations That Drive More Shares?"
msgstr "Želite li napredne fly-in animacije koje povećavaju broj deljenja?"

#: classes/class-ssb-settings.php:706
msgid ""
"Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you create a custom Fly In box with your own "
"title and message,\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tchoose its position and animation, and even display share "
"counts or total shares to build social proof.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYou can fine-tune timing, icon spacing, and colors to match "
"your brand, and control which post types it appears on.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIt's a great way to prompt visitors to share right when "
"they're most engaged."
msgstr ""
"Simple Social Buttons Pro vam omogućava da kreirate prilagođenu fly-in "
"kutiju sa svojim naslovom i porukom,\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tizaberete njenu poziciju i animaciju, pa čak i prikažete broj "
"deljenja ili ukupne delove kako biste izgradili društveni dokaz.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tM možete fino podesiti vreme, razmak između ikona i boje koje "
"odgovaraju vašem brendu, i kontrolisati na kojim tipovima objava se "
"pojavljuje.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTo je odličan način da podstaknete posetioce da podele baš "
"kada su najviše angažovani."

